# MONKEY PLAZA
### Enter the Plaza. Become a Monkey.

Monkey Plaza is a fun and social multiplayer VR game where you become a monkey, explore different environments, climb, jump, and hang out with other players.

Move using your hands, explore the world, meet new players, and create your own fun. Whether you want to explore, play around, or simply chill with friends, Monkey Plaza is the place to be.

**Available on Meta Quest.**

## ABOUT THE GAME

Monkey Plaza is a VR experience inspired by gorilla-style movement games. Instead of using traditional movement controls, you use your hands and arms to move around the world.

Explore different areas, meet other monkeys, and enjoy a social VR experience where every session can be different.

## FEATURES

**Gorilla-Style Movement**

Use your hands and arms to move, climb, jump, and explore your surroundings.

**Multiplayer Experience**

Meet other players, hang out with friends, and enjoy the game together.

**Explore the World**

Discover different environments and find new places to explore.

**Play Your Way**

Have fun, make friends, explore, and create your own adventures.

**Made for VR**

Experience Monkey Plaza in virtual reality on Meta Quest.

## THE COMMUNITY

Monkey Plaza is all about having fun together. Meet new people, play with friends, and become part of the community.

Whether you're a new player or have been playing VR games for years, there's always something to explore.

